SI popped out of oversold"], "n": 1}, "ladder": {"state": "BOTTOM WATCH", "label": "NEARING A LOW", "action": "GET READY", "dir": "down", "score": 16, "why": "Day 37 of a typical 36-42-day cycle \u2014 inside the window where lows usually form. No confirmed turn yet.", "next": "Wait for the turn: a move above the low candle's high, then a close back above the 10-day average. Daily momentum is ~3 bars from a bullish cross.", "weekly_ok": false, "regime": "neutral", "regime_label": "MIXED", "regime_why": "weekly momentum positive; but rolling toward a weekly cross-down; 3-day crossed down", "regime_score": -1.0, "regime_line": "Bigger picture: MIXED \u2014 weekly momentum positive; but rolling toward a weekly cross-down; 3-day crossed down (investor cycle week 22 \u00b7 daily cycle day 37).", "summary_line": "Short-term (daily): nearing a low. Bigger picture (no clear trend): mixed.", "synthesis_line": "", "synthesis_line_zh": "", "points": ["Bigger picture is mixed (no clear trend for a daily long)", "Still below the 10-day average", "Daily momentum ~3 bars from turning up"], "entry": {"tag": "WATCH", "tag_zh": "\u89c2\u5bdf", "urgency": "soon", "days_lo": 0, "days_hi": 5, "text": "A cycle low is due in roughly ~0\u20135 trading days \u2014 watch for the turn, don't front-run it.", "text_zh": "\u5468\u671f\u4f4e\u70b9\u9884\u8ba1\u5728\u7ea6 ~0\u20135 \u4e2a\u4ea4\u6613\u65e5\u5185\u51fa\u73b0\u2014\u2014\u7b49\u5f85\u8f6c\u5411\uff0c\u5207\u52ff\u62a2\u8dd1\u3002"}, "cycle_plain": {"daily_line": "Daily cycle: day 37 of a typical 36\u201342 trading days", "daily_phase": "inside the typical low-timing window \u2014 a dip is more likely from here, though the trend can keep running", "daily_line_zh": "\u65e5\u7ebf\u5468\u671f\uff1a\u7b2c 37 \u5929\uff0c\u5178\u578b\u5468\u671f\u4e3a 36\u201342 \u4e2a\u4ea4\u6613\u65e5", "daily_phase_zh": "\u5904\u4e8e\u5178\u578b\u7684\u4f4e\u70b9\u65f6\u95f4\u7a97\u53e3\u5185\u2014\u2014\u4ece\u6b64\u5904\u56de\u8c03\u6982\u7387\u66f4\